   {
    "claim": "Daily data show P-2 was shut for 2 days then restarted at 40% choke, with BHP about 25.9 bar higher the next day.",
    "detail": "2018-11-05 oil 0, choke 0, bhp 226.91; 2018-11-06 oil 0, choke 0, bhp 227.71; 2018-11-07 oil 441.64, choke 40, bhp 227.97; prior 2018-11-04 bhp 204.07, choke 70; BHP increase 25.91 bar in evidence.",
